#: badend5:badend5_6351FB7A_66F2_4D5F_92D5_D0504CA5F338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71a400fe5b67488401c6de433358b7b504d3b70cc541b9f820a929064485a20a
